{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11b4b9560f8164cf8d157d8ca267133ba8fbdb93f1b10125650284748d96d9a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9920d3743be9664afe19a18a9c32ee1dac34a5fd5381c6b18f5dc40c83770da3",
      "text": "在理想与现实的夹缝中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97fc742662f6c8267cb1813241e554217c661db6110c3636da3b3f38e5e9a3fd",
      "text": "通过315 Pro试镜的\n辉、薰、翼3人，为了正式出道，\n开始一起进行课程训练。然而\n几人迟迟无法达成默契，终于辉与薰\n爆发了冲突。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9920d3743be9664afe19a18a9c32ee1dac34a5fd5381c6b18f5dc40c83770da3",
      "text": "在理想与现实的夹缝中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000025:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc9d21d6295f571284f2002c1d4a692902bfb70cd212c7eb412fbb74166ac41c",
      "text": "那么，最后请天道辉先生。\n说明一下应聘动机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e188ba292e0edfae947be2071070d2daf907218007339682921b3c6c5ec586ff",
      "text": "应聘动机吗……\n老实说，我记不太清了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02bf7f853cfda9ffe95784efc76abf229bf85979574743f87afc0f5156ebad34",
      "text": "但是，喝醉了的我说过要干吧？\n说要成为偶像，让大家都露出笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22672f7ee35bbf95a7af7c81da2c79983f7bf3ae0ba08a171a8b446ea2e69ae8",
      "text": "既然说过一次了，那就只能上了啊。\n我的信条，可是“坦率正直地活着”嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb294ba80bfd13e93f51035ec50928c1587b5042e75e78be0a7b29791eb08dc",
      "text": "到了这个年纪还当偶像，\n虽然有点不好意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccdd5733293a6b3ead0a6f2a9bf689781e9e8b0664dca801bbc5a2663c6c604",
      "text": "即使如此，只要合格了，\n我就会以我自己的方式努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ea9d76b7081f005f0532a3df7e5885e4edb24ea51d8d4840b8b61619d55830",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n以上，试镜正式结束。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f8d5a9acdf65596cc8bfa0611f33a044fb6f64be9456e7a2638fff9e71153ba",
      "text": "接下来宣布合格名单。\n被叫到名字的人，请留在原地。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c231ac3695312249e26f481785583e274dddce26636546ef504ad53fa4eb8e61",
      "text": "那么，●●●●プロデューサー。\n拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af9ff6f924a80f0a12c52323be05068a909126477ff312aff7a62c269ef43bc3",
      "text": "好的！那么，我来点名了。\n天道辉先生、柏木翼先生，以及樱庭薰先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ca14142143ba1006ff88b66fbe4c6af25c808cd4e1ec1cab5a5b92c92193a8",
      "text": "在场的这三位，全员合格。\n今后就请多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e129993bc68c39d4cfbf682970d56ac173914e3c3368e25574ea7fd2307b186",
      "text": "噢噢，从今天起我就是偶像了吗……\n重新整顿一下，得鼓足干劲才行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a811c2b160fc8803dc70f3a1a4ef076468992b9985edb7284aabe6d8533195",
      "text": "太好了……\n我才要请您多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce090f535487a1c1a125fea0310e7508c580cd0c9aa0a01115342d802fda70b",
      "text": "恭喜各位合格！\n接下来，我们来谈谈今后的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab30744a56c4921f315afd007c58899c10b842f9742b78197fd87c64c54bd28",
      "text": "今后为了出道，各位需要\n以三人一组的形式参加各种训练课程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1aa0355b96f38ff47ca295c7ede0aed1faab8cb5d247a1f9df48b68af857bfb",
      "text": "……等等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1ce7aea768c8cd9fce4795edb1780306a8b78a2f68d96fda169b87d63d384f3",
      "text": "？好的，请问有什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6efccfb257b931e294d0af1f35783293b0a1f7bae420701533736fcd257a349",
      "text": "难道说，是要我和这两个人组队\n出道吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e404d44f87a3569d1aae52a5bbf562813fd3038cb839dff9f35f93b854b99c2",
      "text": "不，倒也不是这么绝对……\n但也有这种可能性！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:359a55ff8eff20068975c76a2e19e6156b1c43551b3bd4933450cdf6dfff52cc",
      "text": "是吗。\n既然这样，刚才的合格我就放弃了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eac3bdf6a1fe0ba76ebf56e824137916380a28e7455c97d9b7694ad3e815739",
      "text": "哎哎！为、为什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c7c55ca0df989665e822b7a3230867bdb320303ef00e47847b8ee2f71f1a319",
      "text": "我没有必要和任何人组队。\n一个人就足够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bc1985d961b1c6224031a5ab642b97d4e303cd47ff29f8e72cbd57a9c1f596",
      "text": "为了证明这一点，\n我会再去参加一次试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f18ff87f3fe277500031c1f18c37e9404decec2bfe6e88ffc5373f9100fa48b",
      "text": "并且，要让他们承诺让我一个人出道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b851c2edb85bd440ff3eeae5a758b3fcdecdde22319a882788bd2c54e0a50ba",
      "text": "不过要参加的，大概不是这间事务所的试镜\n就是了。……其他参加者的水平太低了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad03bedb1ff7df386680ad2cbdb0b8e038bd24dc1ffcf75abc3efb6db23fc3c",
      "text": "喂，对刚见面的人，\n用这种说话方式不太好吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1e224636d53220184d2374419d553db3daa7aa71dfa25a9ae48f23d2944e61c",
      "text": "刚才被问到应聘动机时也是，\n冷冰冰地回了句“为了挣钱，就这样”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1b9b702313469c38f0ca9257efc02d72367325350cb9d0246aa3b7c1b5c375c",
      "text": "话说从在候考室的时候开始，\n你的态度就很冲了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9584af3e2982d07142fcb780d72059e0f21154d628c1f136221a849c2e4d28e",
      "text": "态度冲？希望你不要产生奇怪的误解。\n我不过是在陈述事实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000053:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "数小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc0360162646fd8174872a2d244cbf14c1e7e3cd0fc2b90ce986630d3ecc3849",
      "text": "接下来就是偶像试镜了吗。\n……话说，这展开也太快了吧。真是伤脑筋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eed3c72d7b4adb45aa72bbac86411d6b7be484aeecbe2dd2244ffdbf34ecd19",
      "text": "那天晚上确实喝得挺多的啊。\n就算这样，怎么就变成这副局面了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07af532934bca8f0d91ab4d27c07152c89ff10bba847061869d0c7cf75b4d7fc",
      "text": "带着那样半吊子的意志，\n也来参加试镜吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e45ee77bac10e58266d2289d4396e524235de0cdc17d5240f9e509699b88e96",
      "text": "没有站在顶峰的觉悟的话，那就出去如何。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b09718b4905659b8077cfd13b068654640f5a2bb220813ed6ca3f1eaa6c649",
      "text": "这里是怀揣梦想的家伙们\n带着觉悟一决胜负的场所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84894d1fe9785ac2d1b2c0abe744322c188fce8ec3fabbe78292d07465d6b418",
      "text": "毕竟看你的样子，根本就没有那种东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b44875f683a9bd81f4851a6ed6a546265ceef302ba7400813731e48be2844a0",
      "text": "……你说我，没有觉悟？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e60d704e45c927e3902dabda9b3399edd96f67e7d95a568c051517ab9279904",
      "text": "刚才还对我大言不惭说什么“没有觉悟”，\n结果你自己一合格，就打退堂鼓要逃跑了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd2a02f9e5275c77996249657978ac650e42d7401b7c2025cca5a62428974ce",
      "text": "……就是因为有觉悟，我才说不想和你们这群\n平庸之辈组队的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d84d9f836f0a55df74243b2e4136ba335b83c4dd82d6b1285d5e9390d137c5",
      "text": "（哇啊，怎么办。\n这两个人火气越来越大了。得劝劝他们……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf060dc5f413e3a61bacd0097dc98888442e9bb6c8cbc82a7b5649d96cb6f275",
      "text": "薰先生，就算您打算再次参加试镜，\n要不要先参加我们这里的训练课程呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c5a8456039a301e5ede284954b1487814d5d7d39dd94f65ece3e62aa875658c",
      "text": "这是偶像事务所开设的专业课程。\n能高效提升行业内所需的各项技能哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1c462b04a6cd434b53d7800f91cae888f8e0dd45896ac115b4646fec167c8d",
      "text": "……原来如此。有几分道理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db3d236c2d9814b93bcffe4a4bb4976428bf7a4fd419686a8dfcea468555acb0",
      "text": "也好，课程我就去参加吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e161604530d802019adedba92a442c16b85ff7dfdfb27ce9487973d55000056e",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么贤君，请继续说明吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5d450e1ebb68bf5544a66328e04809bb5c30ce6f050d5adc77295c0692bc5a8",
      "text": "好的！\n那么，关于大家要参加的课程……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e37993508337361858e65385024909d370d50296c9499791b8fa52d6754ddc3",
      "text": "训练第一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6d3a0ef9711f9d426dd8a970505409e33658b31198243dab1a63298b38e963",
      "text": "～♪　～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:233e18bade3c7aa10ef9a4760d6592c6995ff91ca3fd5b5c4551238776638d1b",
      "text": "……天道。歌词记错了。\n完全背熟之后再来参加课程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:068fe0b7595a94ac9b04822342d963c47c24e95f426625b26e4c0a234f98a433",
      "text": "诶，真的假的！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a070690291fdd223d2c59dbc2574aafdff12081cbc9b997f3c92867f14fa4f50",
      "text": "柏木没有准确把握音准。\n自己心里也有数吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc7f90275ad6ee9e652a807203c6d48e4440d6a48101122b2192ccbe94d27946",
      "text": "对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac6621d0cbeb5826459a59849bfdc792810672143be30e75bb430f6bceab70a",
      "text": "你们两个，只有这种程度也敢来参加训练吗。\n……果然，没有和你们组队的价值。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce67aaea4cd95e5708dcbeeb0d362898bf959672a981a35b817ca561003cb585",
      "text": "你这家伙……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:465c10d6b9cf975b9eb10db2b5dcdaafdb1589464cb8e84cb3696506fa1f3ca5",
      "text": "算、算了算了！薰先生指出的也很中肯。\n我会把歌好好重新背一遍的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000077:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46bf1dd138dc2681c78e757853280733f2cb1c735af87660826172f8520da4fb",
      "text": "两位，训练辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0540dbad7b3772fe11563c378f4026bc1af28e01ca74001e15ba929ca66853af",
      "text": "哎呀～一开始净是些不习惯的事情让人手忙脚乱，\n但到最后完全投入进去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0847bc92a0e9e706c7fe90c4af41639d3cb5f87eea92ddbcb501c564e09943db",
      "text": "呵呵，我也是。\n虽然唱歌跳舞都很难，但是很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77548a0b45368fe46338f4521f951d430c36c2c7c0b81baa2ac46e6146e7785e",
      "text": "……喂，樱庭？\n今天的课程已经结束了哦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfcc35e86eaf0eb1c4cc2aabd79b353cff8103dad8aeca0fcbf16d3fbee8c4bf",
      "text": "你们回去就行了。我要留下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19934cb1db8c528ca12e8483ae0f7ca9aa99e377e0ccca3c675a58c8f30b93a",
      "text": "呼～……！今天也累趴下了。\n但是，总觉得我们稍微进步了一点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2a3833e670995451eb53e2f5a34d7c676c41d91120b0f5a5ef52b9624ad9d6",
      "text": "是啊！啊，说起来，\n今天刚学到的这个转身动作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e331bd91a2702dd734483d8671999a7b76ab286075edf4a7be1820185c7b049",
      "text": "（那个舞步，本该能做得更流畅的。\n为什么，脑子里明明明白，身体却……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d780e21a31ee75672e0604ab6efe0a962e7fd0324d0213514a6189b8e5d34127",
      "text": "那个，薰先生。接下来我要和辉先生\n一起复习今天的训练内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eaa15567c24af462c39ad65a0a87f9d40fb6ca1ca289015056b8bace6d0c965",
      "text": "如果可以的话，要不要一起呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:610fef3e12a4824b9deb7bca1d910d5b4761f0d5e8d281a8c8e091e67a022bf1",
      "text": "拒绝。我不想被别人打乱自己的节奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c64d9210e3e8094c0f8645cb9518ec500eb97f1cc0a5b2e8692f62365b94df",
      "text": "……樱庭。你这家伙，总是自己一个人加练呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4172a67e7947bc30afa5bb53451bd0ba15911eb7d605684391d53dcaeb15a371",
      "text": "你也和我们一样并不是完美的。正因为明白这点，\n你才会那么拼命去练习的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5be2c2008a52ff15c69936cf614595ab833fd2bc197906328ab983283a0b0f4",
      "text": "既然这样，三个人齐心协力的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f",
      "text": "…………唔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62c3e0b59f4211af2487e19d653105e26519393f897e9ab934865f6630c90a65",
      "text": "啊，薰先生……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4965f3129b693a8ce32e48d57441f33032d1ee43dc2680b5802d9fcdece46dae",
      "text": "……是觉得我们根本没有交流的价值么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd57921979d124e46cd82acb35d7395507bbe3b1cfe556033765b5a2f72546b3",
      "text": "……正是。让开，挡路了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c09c1a0e85646a10c6b61f3ca1d57382eb47c8c271de4cf151a513574345db1",
      "text": "……适可而止一点吧。有种把你刚才的话再说一遍！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae",
      "text": "……啧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff44db6db8b230c5d024d00f8bf9c45d12f1f685811e2063c4a0bc5a09324092",
      "text": "你们两个！快住手啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ba5f63568d1a2ab1f0cbe6fd89097aadb0c318b65cba044ff7567676625767",
      "text": "之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8c0015cdb4a261f2a6a47c9e17f7c528ceb2bc7819faa70a7afeb78c6c2deb0",
      "text": "呼……、哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:028b6e82d6a71f80fea2b5dcc583f7c03ced3310b2ffcf8c0d96217b695c6ab7",
      "text": "哈啊……、啧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a98a9e9811f13bfca622fa9eb9ddaa1fbfda5232a6886b10847b2f0849eb3ef6",
      "text": "（脸稍微肿起来了吗。\n偶像的脸明明也是吃饭的本钱，天道那家伙……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51c3f201e55031b1a31ca3e9c78410914d3f4f298aa8d85d9efd9c29cf5b9a1c",
      "text": "……好痛……哈啊……真是的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e40d23352d0ea8ca3f85e08f325dcfe22c291f9c969fe74622333cdd856a7870",
      "text": "……喂，樱庭。你为什么\n非要做到这种地步去当偶像啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd0f5d8e85a4277e30a4f9038a0e009ef702ee88ac4488f3acad0a17acdad685",
      "text": "……与你无关。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1324effa171856dbfcd85b210b862089749670d28fd61178d2197e4829550e6",
      "text": "……搞什么啊。\n莫名其妙的家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9ace7962b8bd2d85a4a7c974ee591967828156c037d1ab30900e68c2e13dae",
      "text": "（……没错。那家伙的话也好，任何人也好，都与我无关）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:826f97b8795e35f6a6f6ceb0ea918b2ee1d06907b4c14810db90f5106330bf58",
      "text": "（我只要瞄准顶峰前进就行。\n……为了那个人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71e8ec48dbd1100f502d86180c3231a4b3b8e57b2a4d36672d845907f5cce7fb",
      "text": "很好听的歌声呢。\n谢谢你总是唱歌给我听，薰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_g:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751caa660ea8cef0cd2782cd2227bf4b49aad0c3532fcbcadb96171eafc39839",
      "text": "姐姐高兴的话，我也很开心哦。\n为了能唱得越来越好，我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc78ff7f8e0ffefbbab35a9f69277d00f69eada4a6b2fd1da12f510c8c4b5f9f",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊……姐姐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:687aac1aec14559fee9193a00981a94f51c46c7016ae47bedec0fb8ebacc363f",
      "text": "姐姐……是我啊，是薰啊。\n求求你睁开眼睛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0b6f3e6d7d7ca66cebc76347795925e9d2fcc4543b96b8ac31ba99573e6fc43",
      "text": "呜、呜呜……姐姐……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9730de01b6a982afa06b999148b15df6e1e1ea5c41d860eaff6edf2c03e7901d",
      "text": "（和父亲、母亲不一样。\n只有姐姐，没有抛弃我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bca3d41539b8425a98e185d28b6b3084a0fc4731944f713697af2825d2d7f1b5",
      "text": "（真真切切地注视着我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000066:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "数年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f7d2d9ff005aa60384491137378b99fdc964b047831cc4b8afb5c4ef4d295c7",
      "text": "我听说了哦，樱庭！那台手术，\n是你做成功的吧？真不愧是你啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e23bd589dafd9be3cc251a3b3c3c0543709989b948ed0a23a421a811c13f5d11",
      "text": "那种程度的处置，能做好是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ec11324ec608197f479fee3bee2aade754bcda4c8a176678d435209f010cc62",
      "text": "你要是有闲工夫在这里废话，\n不如去为下一台手术做准备如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3273e9e6a2f1d07fae9748cc2e8486e06a944ae9381c927af42d81ecb7cd86c2",
      "text": "哈哈，依然是嘴上不饶人啊。\n嘛，不过你这种一本正经的地方，我挺佩服的就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91256eeb61a1c106e7cad5144a6aa66cc5a26fb364744d8643bddd6cacb3672e",
      "text": "……我先走了。\n我不想浪费休息时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd75266cdbb318b9109c8671df6cc8f98371742369debb059be5f16e4cd125fb",
      "text": "啊，喂，樱庭……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e3825defe86d72096c70fb901ebb76101061e27e231ad6b771a4b9e277c4b38",
      "text": "……樱庭医生虽然很优秀，但真难接近啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbc64f29006dda6d0777e64501bcd8bd6e295f4886b10093004a423f2d7d851",
      "text": "是啊。每次都是那副态度，\n稍微有点搭不上话的感觉呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d11d3b4f90a3396b0ca1b8f6fc6615bea2bb9e3078cb14b47def2728d9c0021",
      "text": "（闲扯空话的时间，我一秒都没有）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98cb2431df011c2b9b5b1d83130713003aeaaea4bb65ec19a2ac1619ef37093",
      "text": "（将夺走姐姐性命的疾病从这个世界上消除。\n为此需要做的事情堆积如山）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1affd247026dd56d1c487f75136b8531527edef38407eda7d209835654fb5180",
      "text": "（但是，即便付出了所能想到的全部努力……\n得到了现在的地位和能力，至今依然）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e49d724ecbb30d90459a7c3addbf0d0cd76fde3f505cd58bb6a9280bb0ec1db3",
      "text": "（想要根绝疾病，欠缺的东西实在太多了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68c9ce42c32ce4e4e8a39317937580010edb5c9e4629d8083f1b73b4d8534e35",
      "text": "（并不是说只要在医师的道路上爬到顶点，\n就可以解决一切的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59e689c62a259092b5019c9fa01725b1f16fe1ca503812146fac10630d771d5a",
      "text": "（光靠医生一个人根本得不到的，\n巨额资金、人脉、组织力量……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e4487f4ae5eda46e7b028756a735fb4e822e3bd021683170a35ec312f886d77",
      "text": "……尤其是钱。\n要配齐必要的设备，需要巨额的资金。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:806cde8fb1e5b994a000f028c7bb2df058e343587363831ed2e4ab42789d2ffa",
      "text": "（现在的做法，行不通吗？\n必须去寻找其他的突破口吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8835498138b7495a8f29c03c50b3b13c033da29d4cf03ee0aaeeab61eddabf",
      "text": "那个……您没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_i:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ffb3bf5bb9c3dd77216e6ef1bcd68c29e91656bef4687084cb9cb3518eb42",
      "text": "总觉得，您好像一直在烦恼着什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a0b8ca7ed033d9098d32a790158f544fb75643b3ae123f51418c2ce18b88651",
      "text": "啊，薰先生！\n太好了，原来您在这里啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7c0572843f2594e904c18badb7e3f2de3357e471b476b1c779dda36163a2b0",
      "text": "我把您落在训练室里的\n行李带过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18534b0ae758a31c6a7330217642eea4eff5d4a8e34c969ff50167cf4928e61",
      "text": "……我本来打算晚点回去拿的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a39b77040549e124ba50242e10b835fc4f5fce0e5fd6fab9681cfd9d86f1d595",
      "text": "这样啊。\n看来是我想多了，不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ecf5557e2de32d212e225db800808bd47fa4d90458361d8d05866afbb25f354",
      "text": "我能稍微在您身边歇会儿吗？\n因为跑得太急，有点累了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae88ad4e66e6ca33703127352f349e08dbeb2c6c50f02894facec153f25624f7",
      "text": "真是拙劣的谎言呢。\n实际上，不过是想来看看我的情况吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c6970f6c66bd4d35ffab3fe076ad8e2b6dc1d33e024f5aa7d61559e2ea65eda",
      "text": "是的。……能告诉我您刚才在想些什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b39d9a9722372aadaa0f1d727f3dacca3f7945dd7f7d2a0bdf1d49371ea82577",
      "text": "……想起了被你发掘的那一天的情景。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb0fdc3ea8205fe70c406024961fe1057e35562e738d03e2ba4dd09f4d0633e3",
      "text": "被你说着“既然那么需要钱，当偶像\n怎么样”这样的话唆使，并接过名片的那一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d74aa3a2e2794763318045ee31f0f9df8110b1d35d047f0dfacfac91950de4",
      "text": "虽然感慨良多……\n但你所说的话，以及我的决断应该是正确的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1947b629ca7bbb56fa9c75e4f0ecdb35f0d4715ab77cb874ad22ab419ffa946",
      "text": "换作是我，很快就能成为一流的偶像。\n并且必定也能登上顶尖偶像的宝座吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe8755f4aa5cf62b27e8f580628e903ff73513da5a3d1d7800e5626087269991",
      "text": "如此一来，正如我所愿，\n在短时间内就能获得巨额的财富。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa93862f2ac7181dbef817ef977846388a98932b1b52ee2a9ec33d79fcd8f5ea",
      "text": "……我，为了那个人……\n无论如何，都必须得到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1111d1bd57718b36bd3c145844c85c2721300755b193dbcd6e59f0b035f73175",
      "text": "……为了某个人而不断努力的身影，\n无论是薰先生，还是辉先生，都很相似呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fef2c6846e8a8cee278f931d80aa8c33b36246c71b71e538a9ee45a738c91cc",
      "text": "我，和那个男人……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
